MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Box 52742 (0 of 2 on 0138+0139). The owner line „მინდა <target>-ს
დავუკავშირდე. ვისი გავლით შემიძლია?" ran three searches and web_search,
and never find_warm_path; the members' chain owner → B1 → B2 → target never
reached the reply. Three causes, three fixes, no new model-facing words:

- personByName: „დავუკავშირდ…", „ვისი/ვის გავლით", "through whom" and
  "how can I connect with" are read as asking for a person by name, so
  0125's web hold covers this line too. A trade line keeps the web.
- warmPathAfterSearch: after a round with a person search, on such a line,
  the next call is forced to find_warm_path, once. Forcing it FIRST failed
  (box 52110, no target yet); after the search the target is in hand.
- findWarmPath: the graph's shortest paths are joined by 1849's members-only
  chains (memberMiddles), deduplicated; a failed members read leaves the
  graph's paths alone.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
